<title>UK: One Brent cargo kept, second clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>One Brent cargo kept, second clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of two Brent cargoes which turned wet on Wednesday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by British Petroleum (BP), traders said.</p>
<p>The other was clocked to Shell U.K., they added.</p>
<p>Both cargoes are due to load in the September 26-28 range. --London newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
